Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-pyqt6, libmpv2 | libmpv1, python3-mpv
Recommends: yt-dlp, fluid-soundfont-gm
Description: Cross-platform bilingual (RO/EN) multimedia player
 MMP Player is a lightweight multimedia player built with PyQt6 and libmpv,
 supporting local video/audio files, MIDI playback, YouTube streams, and
 bilingual Romanian/English interface.
